# Environment — never commit real secrets. See .env.example.
.env
.env.local
.env*.local

# src/generated/seed-spec.ts is written by scripts/embed-spec.mjs from
# ai-service/openapi.yaml, and is COMMITTED on purpose.
#
# Vercel deploys this directory as the project root, and its "include source
# files outside of the Root Directory" setting is easy to leave off — in which
# case ../ai-service/openapi.yaml is simply not in the build. Committing the
# generated file means the build does not depend on that checkbox, and
# `npm ci && npm run build` works in a standalone copy of web/.
#
# It cannot drift: predev and prebuild regenerate it whenever the contract is
# reachable, which locally it always is.
